You have to define the non-linear parameters in the order you are using them. That is, go for

circular_f2 = bf(
  l_confidence ~ bias +
    F(0, l_prior   + I, wSelf) +
    F(0, l_sensory + I, wOthers),
  bias + wSelf + wOthers + aSelf + aOthers ~ 1 + (1|p|Participant),
  nlf(I ~ F(aSelf, l_prior, wSelf) + F(aOthers, l_sensory, wOthers)),
  nl = TRUE)

